{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing the image encoder with ViT in a multimodal multiprofile setup using avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6352 and F1 of 0.6183 suggest a slight decrease compared to the prior resnet50 setup (0.6390 accuracy), indicating potential limitations of ViT in this context. Uncertainty remains about whether other factors or alternative encoders could yield better results, as the comparison isolates only the image encoder change."
}

